window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Step into the captivating world of <i>The Timeless Courtship Series</i> with its first installment, <i>A Waltz Through Time</i>.</p> <p>A <b>relic lost to time.</b> A <b>woman out of place.</b> A <b>love that defies centuries.</b></p> <p>Maggie Spencer’s ordinary life shatters when a mysterious artifact pulls her from the modern world and casts her into the grandeur of <b>Regency England</b>—a time of lavish ballrooms, whispered intrigue, and strict societal rules. Stripped of her identity and thrust into a world where appearances are everything, Maggie must rely on her wits and survival instincts to navigate the dangerous waters of the aristocracy.</p> <p>Amidst the glow of candlelit soirees and the treacherous undercurrents of <b>family secrets</b>, she finds an unexpected ally in <b>Viscount Atlas Montgomery</b>—a devoted scholar with a protective streak that threatens to unravel her carefully guarded defenses. As their connection deepens, Maggie discovers that she may not be the only one drawn to the relic’s power… and that the truth about her past holds more weight than she ever imagined.</p> <p>With <b>high-stakes mystery, slow-burn romance, and a touch of magical realism</b>, <i>A Waltz Through Time</i> is a <b>spellbinding tale of fate, love, and the secrets that bind us across centuries</b>. Perfect for fans of <i>Outlander</i> and <i>Bridgerton</i>, this <b>breathtaking historical romance</b> will sweep you away into a world where love transcends time itself.</p>"; 
